 # non_negotiables: surface syntax unchanged (sigils stay; renames touch concept names in code/docs only); canonicalize roundtrip byte-stable on all 344
}

^["stream"]{
 >>[2026-07-23 03:05] observe — #: and #> fall to Prose; #!/## lex clean; ~# has its own matchAnnotation. Inconsistent recognition of one family: ⟨stance⟩#⟨aim⟩name.
 >>[2026-07-23 03:06] decide — treat as one DIRECTIVE token family with stance (prefix) and aim (postfix) slots; # is the resonance/metadata plane, stance = modality entering the plane (~ defer, $ substrate, = config…), aim = what the mark does (> points, : classifies, ! asserts).
 >>[2026-07-23 03:08] observe — wild exotics ($#e, =#p) prove authors already compose stances; lattice recognition legitimizes existing practice rather than inventing new syntax.
 >>[2026-07-23 03:10] decide — user aims recorded: (1) enhanced indexing + discoverable referential patterns + new structured-relationship encodings; (2) Spw ethos — expressive cognitive modeling, constructs that invite wonder; (3) renaming the combinatorics is open. Renames = concept vocabulary, never sigils.
 >>[2026-07-23 03:12] decide — anchored-node relation: a directive binds to the expression that FOLLOWS it (doc-comment placement). #>anchor → the next node is the anchored node; that binding is the export/index table fragments resolve into.
 >>[2026-07-23 03:20] decide — naming = LINGUISTIC PARTICLES (user): family `particle ⟨stance⟩#⟨aim⟩name`; #> deixis (points at the node that follows), #: case (classifies bearer's role), #! mood (asserts pragmatic force), ~# aspect (deferred state-in-time). Sigils unchanged; code/types/canon adopt the vocabulary.
 >>[2026-07-23 03:40] note — detour before commit 2 (user): evaluated the grok stash for integration. Verdict: main's reconciliation already superseded it — all three insertion-heavy residues (topography-scan local types, vscode roots.ts hardcoded map, dev.ts inlined walker) move logic OUT of shared modules, opposite of the new module-consumability priority. Payload archived on feature/grok-lsp-reconciliation.
 >>[2026-07-23 03:55] implement — commit 2: matchParticle lexes #>name (deixis) and #:name (case) as single PARTICLE tokens (aim in token.kind), registered before the operator matcher. Deliberately incremental: #!/##/~#/#[ untouched; bare #>/#: without a name left alone; strings safe. Corpus: 344/344 parse, token count 190858→187538 (~3.3k particles unified). Gates: types baseline, seed 370+6, cli 101; runtime failures (4) confirmed pre-existing via clean-branch stash check.
 >>[2026-07-23 03:22] decide — user: recognize FILE PATTERNS for semantic depth. First-class pattern: the header particle stack (deixis + case/mood pair — `#>anchor` `#:layer #!pragmatics`) opening ~every canonical file. Census commit added: discover recurring particle stacks corpus-wide (spw:formula/analyze), name them in the registry, refactor only where a recognized pattern adds nuance — never mechanical rewriting.
}

